Now the flow makes perfect sense!
 1. The user clicks **"Validate Request"** (Manual) or **"Validate & Prepare Batch"** (Excel).
 2. They arrive at Step 3, choose their schedule, and click **"Submit"**.
 3. They get the official green snackbar: **"Success! Batch ID 12345 has been successfully submitted for approval."**
